WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:01.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hi, there!
-Hi!

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God,
I'm so happy you're back.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:07.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we've talked since,
but let me just say in person,

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:08.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
congratulations
on an incredible job

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:10.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
at the Correspondents' Dinner.
-Thank you, thank you.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:13.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-And how did, uh...

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:16.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was -- It was --
It went great,

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:19.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
and every single person
loved it.

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Yeah.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:21.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Every single person
across the board.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Across the board. Yeah, yeah.
-Never happened before.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:25.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, everyone loved it.
Even, actually,

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sarah Huckabee Sanders
called me,

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she was like,
"I loved it so much.

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:31.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got every joke."
-Really?

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:32.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:34.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
-'Cause I was watching.
There were a few

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:36.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
that seemed like she maybe
didn't like or get.

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:37.537 line:92%
-Well, you know, you give

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:39.873 size:78% position:39%
the best information
you have at the time.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.741 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:44.377 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's a philosophy.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.712 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-You will be very happy.

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:48.815
There was a tweet that I saw,
and knowing our relationship,

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:50.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought you were just
going love this.

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:53.353
This is basically -- C-SPAN
posted that in three days,

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:57.557
you became the most-watched
Correspondents' Dinner ever.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:58.491 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You beat me.

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:02.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, basically, in what
it took me seven years to do,

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:04.330 line:92%
you outdid me in three years.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I'm gonna frame that.
-Yeah, you outdid me.

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:08.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Well deserved.

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:10.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's great.
Yeah, I think that --

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.440
I think that means I'm the
father of your children now.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.975
-Yeah, I think that might be --
that might be it.

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:16.776 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-They're mine now.

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:19.379 size:81% position:41%
-So, I want to ask you
about another photo.

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:21.981
This is afterwards.
This is a bunch of your writers.

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:23.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
-You were just finished,

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you walked into a party,
and this photo, I think,

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
was maybe even in
"The New York Times."

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:28.788 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-[ Chuckling ] Yeah.

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:31.257 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What is everybody chanting
as you walked in?

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They're chanting,
"Lock her up!"

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:36.329 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:39.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A perfect -- A perfect way
to end the evening.

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:41.468 size:78% position:39%
Obviously, you had --
This blows my mind,

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.603
'cause you were preparing for
the Correspondents' Dinner,

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:45.705
you're preparing for your new
show that I want to talk about,

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:50.877
but you also had time to train,
and then run, a 50-mile race.

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:53.580
-Yeah.
-And I know you to be a runner.

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:55.982 --> 00:02:00.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What convinced you
to try to do 50 miles at once?

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:03.123 size:88% position:44%
-Well, I wanted to do --
It's an ultra marathon.

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:06.626
And I wanted to do that because,
like, anyone can do a marathon.

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:09.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, even you did a marathon.
-Yeah, I've done one.

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:11.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Except for that one...
-Yeah.

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:14.601
-...that you didn't finish.
-Well, I had a leg injury.

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:16.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But you didn't finish.
-Yeah.

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:17.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
You couldn't do it, yeah.

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:20.406
-I could have hobbled and done,
like, more damage to my leg.

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:22.609
-Or you could have sucked it up.
-Yeah.

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:23.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, yeah.

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:25.044 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I didn't.
So, but if you --

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:28.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Most people power through it.
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.783 line:92%
-Where did you do your 50-mile?

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:33.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was in the Salt Flats
in Utah.

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:36.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, oh. [ Laughs ]
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:38.458
We have a salt flat here.
-Or just someone who --

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
They just might be
someone who loves salt.

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:43.496 line:92%
-Yeah, it's great. It's just...

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:46.399
No, so then I spent the weekend
in Utah,

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:48.067 line:92%
and that's Mormon country.

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:51.371
And I was at -- I was with
my nephews at a playground.

00:02:51.371 --> 00:02:54.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wasn't by myself, I promise.
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:57.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
But there is this guy
at the playground

00:02:57.043 --> 00:03:00.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
wearing a T-shirt
that said, "Porn kills love."

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:02.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
At the playground!
-Yeah.

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:04.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
-With the children!
-Right.

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:06.920
-'Cause they need to know.
-[ Laughs ] That's true.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:09.222 line:92%
-But I was like -- I was like,

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:12.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
regardless of your feelings
about porn,

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:16.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, graphic tees
definitely kill love.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:17.797 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:22.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's -- No one has ever been
like, "Oh, a graphic tee!

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:25.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like that manatee now."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:29.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's how I proposed.
I wore a "Will you marry me?"

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:30.276 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:32.045 align:start size:94% position:6%
So you're preparing
for your Netflix show.

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:33.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-This is very exciting.

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:36.349
How has preparation gone so far?
-It's great.

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:37.217 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I would have to say

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:40.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
that if you hated
the Correspondents' Dinner,

00:03:40.787 --> 00:03:43.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're really going to
hate this show.

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:43.590 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.759
-That, I think, is good to hear
for a lot of people.

